OCPP 1.6 JSON schemas

The *.json files in this directory are the OCPP 1.6 JSON schemas published by the
Open Charge Alliance in the package "OCPP 1.6 (all files & errata)", errata release 2025-04,
from https://openchargealliance.org/downloads/.

